  Method: the stack bridges its two x230 links (stack port1.0.3 into VLAN 103), so a BPDU the
  x230 sends on port1.0.3 can come back on port1.0.4. Only if port1.0.4 then reads Backup /
  Discarding is the data loop closed (x230 port1.0.4 into VLAN 103) and broadcast sent.
